{
  "_comment": "Pi 400 (BCM2711, 4GB, Bookworm, 1080p display) decode matrix, Lab-B plug .31. BBB only (tmpfs is 1.9G). Two regimes: _full = -stream_loop -1 saturated (matches Pi 5 pi_sw_matrix protocol, 120s); _rt = -re realtime-paced (matches pi_rt_bbb, 150s). Headline arm: h264 HW (bcm2835-codec v4l2m2m, stateful — the decoder the Pi 5 dropped) vs h264 SW on the same board, in both regimes. HEVC hw (rpivid stateless) unreachable on Bookworm userspace, same as Pi 5 — sw only.",
